The device detail tab strip is in ui2/frontend/src/screens/InventoryPanels.tsx, around line 434, and reads exactly:

      <M3Tabs
        ariaLabel="Device detail"
        tabs={[
          {
            label: "Interfaces",
            panel: isCluster
              ? <ClusterInterfacesPanel contexts={clusterInventory?.contexts ?? []} />
